Night & Day brings together a crew of serious selectors for an extended session spanning house, techno and experimental club. Amsterdam’s Interstellar Funk has spent more than a decade moving through the city’s underground, with releases across Rush Hour, Dekmantel, L.I.E.S. and his own Artificial Dance imprint. Colored Craig arrives with his signature soulful, jacking approach that earned him an RA Podcast and a reputation as one of the city’s standout DJs. Marseille’s LAMALICE brings a minimal, rhythmic and technical groove shaped through Sentaku and his Smooth Operators project, while NY regulars Mayell & Sibil for a special B2B. SPRKLBB and Very J complete the lineup for a long-form Friday Night & Day.

