Signal links with MEOKO for a night centered on the deeper end of minimal and house. Oshana leads alongside longtime Rominimal producer Andrei Ciubuc, whose work as both Ciubuc and VRAC has made him a fixture around Romania’s long-running minimal scene, with releases for Subtil, Castanea and Malonian. Brooklyn’s Resolute resident Maksim rounds out the main room, bringing more than a decade of history in New York’s after-hours underground. Robin, Georgia and Camilla take over Signal's new AUX room.

