A heavyweight edition of Night & Day led by one of Berlin techno’s defining figures. Ellen Allien has spent more than three decades at the center of the city’s club culture through BPitch, UFO Inc., her We Are Not Alone and Vinylism parties and an extensive catalogue of her own productions. Rrose joins with the highly detailed, psychedelic techno developed through Sandwell District and their own EAUX imprint, while Mirror Zone founder Spekki Webu pushes further outward into experimental techno, trance and rave psychedelia. Signal resident KYRUH brings the raw, hypnotic pressure that has made her a regular presence across New York’s underground. Up and comer Connor Wrong completes the lineup.

