A night connecting New York with one of Tbilisi’s longest-standing underground figures. Gio Shengelia has been active in Georgia’s electronic music scene since the early 2000s, with years behind the decks at institutions including Mtkvarze, KHIDI and Cafe-Gallery. KT and Woreq join in the main room, while Tripmastaz, Yonit & AMBA and CHKLTE take over AUX.

