Berlin duo ERIS—the collaborative project of Enrica Falqui and Dea Dvornik—bring the intricate, club-focused sound that first emerged through releases on Cabaret Recordings. Onirik arrives from Berlin with more than 15 years behind the decks and the deep record knowledge behind Garage Hermétique and Off The Grid. Montreal-born, Berlin-based Pascale Project brings the playful house, techno and rave sensibility of their Sparkling label, joined by ATEQ, Caim, Daura, GNMR, J. Richards, Kurilo and Lis Dalton across a full day and night at Signal.

