A New York night through and through. Hector Romero brings decades of history stretching from the city’s formative club era through his work with Def Mix and SAW Recordings alongside Satoshi Tomiie. A DJ whose career has taken him from New York to Ibiza and well beyond, Romero is joined by longtime NYC selector Robbie Lumpkin for a special night at Signal.

